    counselling: "Your kidneys are working at only 18% of normal. We need to protect them, manage complications, and prepare for the possibility of dialysis or a kidney transplant in the future. Work closely with the dietitian — what you eat matters a lot now. Take your medications as prescribed. We will monitor your blood tests monthly.",
    followUp: "Nephrology clinic monthly. Prepare for RRT (education, counselling, AV fistula creation when eGFR 15-20). Vaccinations. Annual: cardiac assessment, eye exam, foot exam. Plan for transplant evaluation if eligible.",
